  "description": {
   "en": "This is the story of two very different girls.\n\nWith a 32 cm height difference, the length of their strides, their clothing sizes, and even the clubs they were encouraged to join were all different.\n\nAs Ritsu finds herself drawn to Uno’s cheerfulness, the distance between them gradually grows smaller.",
